message: "If you use this compendium in your study or research, please cite it as below."
title: "Mathematical Methods for Machine Learning"
abstract: >-
  A unified pathway from the foundations of mathematical analysis to advanced
  methods for modeling and inference, covering calculus, linear and functional
  analysis, optimization, Fourier methods, distribution theory, differential
  equations, probability, and stochastic differential equations. Chapters on
  analysis build on the course taught by Prof. Monica Conti at Politecnico
  di Milano.
